---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---
<SiteLayout title="Privacy" description="How Meyo Insights handles optional website analytics.">
  <section class="section wrap" style="max-width:800px">
    <p class="eyebrow">Website privacy</p>
    <h1>Privacy and analytics</h1>
    <p class="lead">Meyo Insights is a public research journal. Reading the website does not require an account or analytics consent.</p>
    <h2>Optional analytics</h2>
    <p>We use Google Tag Manager (container GTM-N667W382) to manage optional website measurement. Google Tag Manager is not itself Google Analytics. Analytics tags in the container, once configured and published, may collect page visits, referral information, general device information and approximate location according to Google's settings and privacy terms.</p>
    <p>We do not load the Tag Manager container until you choose <strong>Accept analytics</strong>. Declining does not affect access to the site. Your choice is saved in this browser's local storage for future visits; you can change it using <strong>Analytics settings</strong> in the footer.</p>
    <p>Changing your preference to Decline stops our optional container loading on subsequent page views. Previously collected information, if any, is not erased by changing the browser setting.</p>
    <h2>What we avoid</h2>
    <p>We do not intentionally send names, email addresses, or private research records as analytics event parameters. We do not run third-party advertising or marketing tags through this consent choice.</p>
    <h2>About Google</h2>
    <p>Where analytics is enabled, Google's processing and retention rules also apply. Learn more from <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy">Google's Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
    <p>This notice will be revised if the site's measurement practices change.</p>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>
